INT. OAKHAVEN WAR COUNCIL CHAMBER - DUSK - 1310

Maps of the seven broken realms lay sprawled across the oak table, weighed down by iron daggers.

LADY MORWEN (45) studies the northern troop movements under flickering torchlight.

GRAND INQUISITOR MALAKOR (52) enters, unrolling a sealed parchment from Frostpeak.

GRAND INQUISITOR MALAKOR
Word from the northern peaks, Lady Morwen. The sanctuary remains inviolate.

LADY MORWEN
And Prince Kaelen? Does he sleep undisturbed?

GRAND INQUISITOR MALAKOR
He remains safely sealed within the Frostpeak Amber Tomb. Not a single fracture has marred the cryo-enchantment since 1292. Ten winters remain until his predicted awakening in 1320.

Lady Morwen exhales a breath of relief, adjusting her obsidian warding ring.

LADY MORWEN
Then we hold the gate with conventional iron and spellcraft. May the old kings rest in their graves.
